### Data Attribution & Scientific Usage Notice
The biological connectome data integrated within this repository originates from the FlyWire Consortium (Princeton University, MRC-LMB, and international collaborators) based on the Full Adult Fly Brain (FAFB) serial-section transmission electron microscopy dataset. 

If you use this software or derived visualizations in academic, clinical, or commercial research, please cite the foundational FlyWire publications:
- Dorkenwald, S., et al. (2024). *Neuronal wiring diagram of an adult brain*. Nature, 634, 124–138.
- Schlegel, P., et al. (2024). *A consensus cell type atlas of the adult Drosophila melanogaster brain*. Nature, 634, 139–152.

